      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Planning an open-plan kitchen? Send photos and plans, and an independent structural engineer will quote to check the wall and design the beam, posts and footings that a registered builder then installs.</p>
